00:18:44.323 --> 00:18:46.492
I'll never be hurt by cars!

00:18:46.792 --> 00:18:49.562
Wait... Traffic Safety!?

00:18:51.197 --> 00:18:52.632
He went along with the joke...

00:19:19.692 --> 00:19:22.662
And so, my summer was finally over.

00:19:39.512 --> 00:19:40.646
Hello?

00:19:41.113 --> 00:19:44.250
Congratulations! it's a boy!

00:19:48.654 --> 00:19:51.123
Is it... Because of my charm?

00:19:52.124 --> 00:19:54.060
Hurry up and help him...

00:19:54.060 --> 00:19:56.295
Hurry up and take him to the hospital!

00:20:05.204 --> 00:20:06.005
| got 'em!

00:20:07.106 --> 00:20:08.841
Hey, hey!

00:20:10.342 --> 00:20:13.179
What just happened? Was that his aura?

00:20:14.747 --> 00:20:16.348
| can't get the goldfish!

00:20:16.348 --> 00:20:18.484
Let's go home, Dad!

00:20:18.484 --> 00:20:19.485
Too late!

00:20:20.119 --> 00:20:21.420
Out of my way!

00:20:21.587 --> 00:20:23.656
Dad! Dad!

00:20:25.357 --> 00:20:27.093
Don't get carried away!

00:20:27.460 --> 00:20:29.562
Goldfish! Goldfish!

00:20:29.562 --> 00:20:31.564
Dad!

00:20:31.564 --> 00:20:33.165
I'm going to go all out.

00:20:33.666 --> 00:20:35.101
Come and get it!

00:20:39.071 --> 00:20:39.805
You're dead!

00:20:43.342 --> 00:20:45.711
Fist of the Nose Hair Secret Technique:

00:20:48.514 --> 00:20:48.547
Stress-Relieving Fist!

00:20:48.547 --> 00:20:50.483
Stress-Relieving Fist!
Stress-Relieving Fist!

00:20:51.717 --> 00:20:53.152
That's it!

00:20:53.152 --> 00:20:55.921
Harder than that!
Much harder than that!

00:20:55.921 --> 00:20:57.723
That hurts! That hurts!

00:20:58.057 --> 00:21:01.794
Stop it! Stop it!

00:21:02.194 --> 00:21:05.030
Alright! Stress relieved!

00:21:05.030 --> 00:21:08.400
Hey! Don Patch, you fool,
take a look at this!

00:21:08.868 --> 00:21:11.070
What are you doing, Bo-bobo?

00:21:11.070 --> 00:21:14.073
Don Patch will get really mad at you!

00:21:29.155 --> 00:21:30.556
You're not getting mad?

00:21:41.634 --> 00:21:46.071
Beauty was thinking,
"This Don Patch is ticking me off.”

00:22:00.252 --> 00:22:01.654
It hit me.

00:22:01.654 --> 00:22:02.755
It sure did.

00:22:14.466 --> 00:22:15.401
Fist of the Nose Hair!

00:22:17.136 --> 00:22:18.170
Bo-bobo!

00:22:18.337 --> 00:22:19.505
That's...

00:22:19.772 --> 00:22:21.440
My afro!

00:22:21.807 --> 00:22:23.242
Hey, that was dangerous!

00:22:33.485 --> 00:22:34.787
You're not giving up, are you?

00:22:39.592 --> 00:22:40.426
Heppy!

00:22:46.599 --> 00:22:50.336
Heppy... What's going on, Heppy?

00:22:58.677 --> 00:22:59.445
A rose?

00:23:03.382 --> 00:23:04.383
Babu?

00:23:04.950 --> 00:23:08.454
What's this!? This is a very
sudden transformation!

00:23:08.454 --> 00:23:13.626
Just what has happened to Heppokomaru
after rising from the ashes?

00:23:14.260 --> 00:23:15.361
Could he be...

00:23:15.361 --> 00:23:19.064
The legendary Rose Warrior...

00:23:19.064 --> 00:23:23.235
That only comes to the world
once every 15 billion years?

00:23:23.369 --> 00:23:26.171
Is Heppokomaru that very same warrior?

00:23:30.342 --> 00:23:31.543
Heppy...

00:23:31.543 --> 00:23:35.581
U...uh... The Rose Warrior
that saved the world...

00:23:35.581 --> 00:23:37.716
From a galactic wave...

00:23:37.850 --> 00:23:40.586
Is Heppokomaru that very same warrior?

00:23:41.654 --> 00:23:44.323
That legend doesn't exist!

00:23:44.456 --> 00:23:49.728
In the language of flowers, roses
mean "Bobobo-bo Bo-bobo."

00:23:53.666 --> 00:23:55.701
What's going on, Heppy!?

00:23:55.768 --> 00:23:58.404
That's not what roses mean!

00:24:00.639 --> 00:24:02.641
You see, I snapped back for you.

00:24:05.177 --> 00:24:12.785
Happy, happy, I'm always happy...

00:24:19.058 --> 00:24:25.898
Where does happiness come from?

00:24:25.898 --> 00:24:31.170
I will go to you again today.

00:24:32.838 --> 00:24:39.745
Happiness comes
suddenly when I'm sleeping.

00:24:40.679 --> 00:24:43.549
If you're happy,

00:24:43.549 --> 00:24:48.320
show everyone by raising
your arms into the air!

00:24:49.922 --> 00:24:57.329
Happy, happy, I'm always happy.

00:24:57.696 --> 00:25:03.669
I wish that it would never end.

00:25:03.669 --> 00:25:12.411
Happy, happy, we are happy!

00:25:12.411 --> 00:25:16.982
Because I am loved...

00:25:18.751 --> 00:25:21.854
...forever!

00:25:24.656 --> 00:25:27.092
Bobobo-bo Bo-bobo

00:25:27.726 --> 00:25:29.328
What's happened to Heppy?

00:25:29.328 --> 00:25:30.829
He's a bit different from normal.

00:25:30.829 --> 00:25:32.431
Has Heppokomaru finally awakened?

00:25:32.431 --> 00:25:32.831
Huh?

00:25:32.831 --> 00:25:33.999
As a wiggin" specialist?

00:25:33.999 --> 00:25:35.034
That's not possible!

00:25:35.034 --> 00:25:36.935
By the way, where's Tokoro Tennosuke?

00:25:36.935 --> 00:25:38.370
We gotta find him soon!

00:25:38.537 --> 00:25:40.139
You're gonna keep him to yourself?

00:25:40.139 --> 00:25:41.974
That's mean, Beauty.
He's a snack for all of us!

00:25:41.974 --> 00:25:43.375
He's no snack!

00:25:43.375 --> 00:25:45.177
Next time on Bobobo-bo Bo-bobo:

00:25:45.177 --> 00:25:48.614
<i>Fist of the Wobble-Wobblie Secret Techniquel Tokoroten Gun Explodes! But I Don't Taste Anything
Fist of the Wobble-Wobble Secret Techniquel Tokoroten Gun Explodes! But I Don't Taste Anything.</i>

00:25:48.680 --> 00:25:50.215
| don't even care!
